{"text":"中明寺比丘尼道揚、道積、道保依方等行道，願造玄〔賢〕劫千佛。但越〔願〕司空公皇甫度及陳夫兄、夫貴鑒夫人、柳夫人、諸貴人等、北海王妃樊，仰爲皇帝陛下、皇太后、曠劫諸師、七世父母、所生父母、見在眷屬、十方法界天道眾生，生生世世侍玄劫千佛，發善惡心，彌勒三會，願登初首，一時成佛。大魏孝昌元年八月十三日訖。","tags":[{"name":"LocName","term":"中明寺","refId":null,"text":"中明寺","start":0,"end":3},{"name":"PersonName","term":"道揚","refId":null,"text":"道揚","start":6,"end":8},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"方等經","refId":null,"text":"方等","start":15,"end":17},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"行道","refId":null,"text":"行道","start":17,"end":19},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"賢劫千佛","refId":null,"text":"玄〔賢〕劫千","start":22,"end":28},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"檀越","refId":null,"text":"但越","start":30,"end":32},{"name":"Office","term":"司空","refId":null,"text":"司空","start":35,"end":37},{"name":"PersonName","term":"皇甫","refId":null,"text":"皇甫","start":38,"end":40},{"name":"PersonName","term":"柳夫人","refId":null,"text":"柳夫人","start":52,"end":55},{"name":"PersonName","term":"王妃","refId":null,"text":"王妃","start":63,"end":65},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"無量劫","refId":null,"text":"曠劫","start":78,"end":80},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"十方","refId":null,"text":"十方","start":98,"end":100},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"法界","refId":null,"text":"法界","start":100,"end":102},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"眾生","refId":null,"text":"眾生","start":104,"end":106},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"賢劫千佛","refId":null,"text":"玄劫千","start":112,"end":115},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"彌勒","refId":null,"text":"彌勒","start":122,"end":124},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"龍華三會","refId":null,"text":"三會","start":124,"end":126}]}